


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_68f220a4:


    "此时伦除了内衣都被剥了个精光。内衣被翻卷着掀了起来，内裤也被拉了下来，各个部位也一览无遗。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_565b4bcd:



    voice "d/2FU_0311"
    fumi "「今天的伦也非常的可爱！漂亮！太美了！无论是发梢还是脚趾全身上下都是那么的棒！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_c2020c18:


    "文这回也是一开始就飚了起来。她这种时候就会不由分说地对伦发起赞美攻势。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_66f75919:



    voice "d/2RI_0365"
    rin "「谢……谢谢」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_521d328c:


    "而虽说伦被表扬赞美时会很高兴，但更多的是感到害羞。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_a31bdf9a:


    "然而文并没有过多在意，而是用着能让伦感觉到吐息般的距离全神贯注地鉴赏着伦的躯体。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_0cc2623a:



    voice "d/2FU_0312"
    fumi "「嗅嗅……伦的味道，闻起来就让人心跳不已呢。平常明明就像大人般成熟可是赤裸的时候却散发着小宝宝的味道」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_c2ce1d03:



    voice "d/2RI_0366"
    rin "「不、不先洗澡就开始做吗……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_5ba790aa:



    voice "d/2FU_0313"
    fumi "「我倒是不在意哦，伦很在意吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_8a955539:


    "文嗅了嗅自己的身体，然后看着伦。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_033e413f:



    voice "d/2RI_0367"
    rin "「……不在意。文平时就散发着香气」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_9ff27e15:


    "文散发着的是……母亲的气味吗。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_a551eedc:



    voice "d/2FU_0314"
    fumi "「呵呵，那太好了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_93e85f98:


    "伦用洗澡的话题来掩盖害羞这点，文在一开始就已经是很清楚的了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_ae1c49fb:


    "第一次在教室做的那回也没有洗澡嘛。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_505f7e38:



    voice "d/2RI_0368"
    rin "「话说……只有我被脱的话，感觉很害羞啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_2d122398:



    voice "d/2FU_0315"
    fumi "「诶～你看我这不也是脱了吗」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_68acd563:



    voice "d/2RI_0369"
    rin "「完全不一样啊。你都还穿着内衣，下面也都还穿着裤袜呢！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_12d714a0:


    "伦控诉着这个不平等的状况。露出了重要部位的确实是只有伦一个。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_cdbf6015:



    voice "d/2FU_0316"
    fumi "「嗯～毕竟是我来做攻的那个嘛，也挺好的不是吗♪」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_95d62a6c:


    "文经过短暂的思考后，马上就驳回了伦。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_ebe84fb4:



    voice "d/2RI_0370"
    rin "「呜哇，好狡猾。我也想给文做——」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_5cf49b69:


    "说起来最早那几次确实是那样。不过感觉已经是很遥远的事了……不对其实才半个月前吧。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_55b45fae:



    voice "d/2FU_0317"
    fumi "「嗯哼哼。那采用轮换制怎么样？等伦满足了以后，伦再对我做什么都可以哦」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_cd095219:



    voice "d/2RI_0371"
    rin "「等下，已经决定是文先攻的吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_78b4cead:



    voice "d/2FU_0318"
    fumi "「没错。因为已经停不下来了喔」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_6c1a1658:


    "文如此说道，并向伦的身体逼近。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_db66951f:



    voice "d/2RI_0372"
    rin "「呜……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_38b1aedb:


    "伦无法抵抗文这笑容所蕴含的压力。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_b07eea6e:


    "两人之间已经攻受分明了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_e3639981:


    "恐怕最后就是这样的结果？不对，不如说必然是这个结果。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_3d5cc70e:



    voice "d/2FU_0319"
    fumi "「啊，今天的话就算你水多也没关系哦」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_2cf77209:


    "文把垫在伦屁股下的浴巾拈起来让伦看了看。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_50ec3a84:



    voice "d/2RI_0373"
    rin "「噗……！？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_dd7214d7:


    "文就是个在这样的状况下也能冷静地发挥着主妇威能的女生。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_d9ec5fdf:



    voice "d/2FU_0320"
    fumi "「伦感到舒服的时候很容易井喷的对吧。如果把床弄湿了的话睡觉时会很冷的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_aba52871:


    "以前伦钻进文的被窝，结果却反过来被文吃掉了。这么一想那就是两人攻受关系被逆转的开端了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_84a67289:



    voice "d/2RI_0374"
    rin "「呜……文变得越来越爱欺负人了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_da71bfac:


    "伦的眼神飘忽不定，大概已经满脸通红了吧。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_6d0b53a0:



    voice "d/2FU_0321"
    fumi "「如果让你想起了羞人的回忆的话我道歉吧。不过，我真的不是想欺负伦才垫浴巾的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_a4b6077b:



    voice "d/2FU_0322"
    fumi "「再说了。就算伦喷了我也一点都不讨厌哦，不如说那样很可爱——」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_f68ca231:



    voice "d/2RI_0375"
    rin "「对——！文就是这点最坏心眼了！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_7b72a0d7:


    "啊哈哈。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_f5b451d3:


    "正如文的想法一样，垫浴巾这动作不如说是体现了文的温柔。而这无微不至的关怀则只是给了伦致命的一击。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_689daca1:



    voice "d/2FU_0323"
    fumi "「不过。伦其实也变得越来越渴望被欺负了哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_c60baf3e:



    voice "d/2RI_0376RE"
    rin "「渴、渴望被欺负？什么啊？我、我才没有渴望呢……那种事」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_5feb6966:


    "伦因为这突如其来的反击而感到困惑。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_3ade571d:



    voice "d/2FU_0324"
    fumi "「因为你看嘛。我是想让伦开心的对吧？然后呢，如果我使坏的话伦会开心对吧？那不是只能使坏了吗」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_095e3f06:



    voice "d/2RI_0377"
    rin "「为什么啊！人被欺负的一部分原因就出在那个人身上，这种论点可是会瞬间陷入争议之中的哦！？欺负人，最讨厌了！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_0a09e3d0:



    voice "d/2FU_0325"
    fumi "「这不是欺负，而是使坏哦。难道伦认为我会做出让伦讨厌的事吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_f8804e77:



    voice "d/2RI_0378"
    rin "「明明就算我说了不要你也还是不会停手的……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_ba7d6d90:



    voice "d/2FU_0326"
    fumi "「如果你真的不愿意的话那我就不做了哦」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_cb8bee33:



    voice "d/2RI_0379"
    rin "「我真正的想法是怎么样的……你又是如何知道的？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_a46b1fb5:


    "守着小小的自尊心却又不知道将其弄丢在哪的伦。文也察觉到后叹气地笑了笑。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_404e6bd8:



    voice "d/2FU_0327"
    fumi "「嗯～哎。我们还要继续这样拌嘴吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_6c87998c:



    voice "d/2RI_0380"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_47c87244:


    "文伸出了手，而伦却没有坦率地作回应，只是不断地转移着视线。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_1d6dd514:



    voice "d/2FU_0328"
    fumi "「难道说伦不想早点做吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_f1ac4f1a:



    voice "d/2RI_0381"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_1482817c:


    "湿润的眼瞳泫然欲泣。伦自己也应该最清楚自己面对文是一点胜算都没有的才对。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_2759ffd4:



    voice "d/2FU_0329"
    fumi "「唉～时间一点一滴地过去了呢～她们说不定要回来了～」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_3ab8a80e:


    "文瞄了下时钟，刻意装出一副很失落的模样。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_f61e010f:



    voice "d/2RI_0382"
    rin "「……呜」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_43b7c961:


    "就差临门一脚了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_6fd50f91:



    voice "d/2FU_0330"
    fumi "「呼。又不是很想做得匆匆忙忙的，今天我们还是就聊聊天吧。等我换件衣服去泡茶——」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_c6ed059f:


    "文说着正准备起身。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_ed5a270a:



    voice "d/2RI_0383"
    rin "「怎么那样……等下」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_cbdbbb66:


    "吓得伦突然抓住了文的肩膀。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_e547ce79:



    voice "d/2FU_0331"
    fumi "「嗯？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_a6bcfe70:



    voice "d/2RI_0384"
    rin "「那……那个……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_62e4feb5:


    "文真的…………………"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_4c89fe9f:


    "非常之………………"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_153f45d3:


    "耐得住性子。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_b87c601c:



    voice "d/2RI_0385"
    rin "「请欺负我吧……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_8e7dd8b2:



    voice "d/2FU_0332"
    fumi "「好♪」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_19c7254d:


    "美丽无比的笑容。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_27c7dea0:



    voice "d/2FU_0333"
    fumi "「你就放心把自己交给我吧，我会让你舒服到底的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_2f5dfd64:



    voice "d/2RI_0386"
    rin "「……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_89b80254:


    "伦点了点头，但依然没能和文对上视线。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_cf790f13:



    voice "d/2FU_0334"
    fumi "「啊啊，侧脸也好漂亮。伦真的是个美人呢」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_5cca233a:


    "注视着伦的脸而陶醉的文如此说道，但其实她自己的相貌也是相当地秀丽脱俗。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_0df78405:


    "没错，她美得就算是哪天被星探挖掘招募也不奇怪。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_1a8ff820:



    voice "d/2RI_0387"
    rin "「……啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_c8b968e8:


    "娇羞的伦还来不及用手遮住脸，文的手就已经触及伦的大腿内侧。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_d9c5e702:


    "掌心顺着那肌肤缓缓地滑动，到了大腿内侧根部后，顺势地向伦私密的地方探去。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_f8fe3af0:



    voice "d/2RI_0388"
    rin "「唏！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_96b88661:



    voice "d/2FU_0335"
    fumi "「这里已经湿漉漉了哦？光是期待着就已经变成这样了呢」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_9b23aa00:



    voice "d/2RI_0389"
    rin "「为什么要说出来！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_2649a482:



    voice "d/2FU_0336"
    fumi "「那是因为啊，羞答答的伦实在太可爱了♪而且那样伦也会有感觉嘛……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_cc86cadb:



    voice "d/2RI_0390"
    rin "「哈啊啊呜呜！？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_156ac978:



    voice "d/2FU_0337"
    fumi "「你看对吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_5d392842:



    voice "d/2RI_0391"
    rin "「你、你太狡猾了！这、这是因为……文把手指插了进来啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_7560231b:



    voice "d/2FU_0338"
    fumi "「诶～我明明只插进了一小节手指哦？这是不是太敏感了点呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_c88ad468:



    voice "d/2RI_0392"
    rin "「我、我才……不敏感呢。很、很普通而已……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_569fe560:



    voice "d/2FU_0339"
    fumi "「呵呵，好的好的。因为我只知道伦的，所以不清楚哪种程度才算是“普通”哦」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_738bc82c:



    voice "d/2RI_0393"
    rin "「……我还不是……只知道文的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_90088dc6:



    voice "d/2FU_0340"
    fumi "「不过，我才不在乎普不普通呢。我只想更深地了解伦，那样就足够了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_cf8c06f0:


    "正如她所说的一样（咦，是么？），文将手指探向伦身体更深的地方。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_3862ef65:



    voice "d/2RI_0394"
    rin "「文、文……嗯嗯！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_c558fabd:


    "伦因为花蕊被逐渐入侵而紧紧地攥着床单。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_357f9d06:



    voice "d/2FU_0341"
    fumi "「好热……感觉手指像是要被烫伤一样」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_ee2e7235:


    "文用柔软的中指缓缓搅动着伦的泉眼。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_207f0d52:


    "话虽如此，文的手指也就只插进去了大概两个关节的长度而已。一眼就能看出文为了不弄伤伦所以碰触得十分小心。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_4ca4acd1:



    voice "d/2FU_0342"
    fumi "「……被吸进去了。感觉就像要把我的手指给吃掉一样」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_0b4bd295:



    voice "d/2RI_0395"
    rin "「嗯嗯……因、因为那里变得……控制不住了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_700444ea:



    voice "d/2FU_0343"
    fumi "「呵呵，那我的手指美味吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_ed3eeb28:



    voice "d/2RI_0396"
    rin "「那、那种事……我怎么会知道啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_8b9bad1a:



    voice "d/2FU_0344"
    fumi "「用这边的嘴巴来尝尝的话，说不定会知道呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_b30b55c5:


    "文说着便用另一只手轻触着伦的嘴唇。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_87119c8a:


    "只是温柔地敲了下嘴唇，伦就率直地含了下去。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_c8212041:



    voice "d/2RI_0397"
    rin "「嗯嗯……啾……嗯咕」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_7faeebca:



    voice "d/2FU_0345"
    fumi "「啊啊……这边的嘴巴也好热……舌头好柔软」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_b66be75c:


    "用不着文下指示，伦就已经开始细心地吮吸着文的手指。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_5b10ba4d:



    voice "d/2FU_0346"
    fumi "「呵呵，好吃吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_d5e903a6:



    voice "d/2RI_0398"
    rin "「呼咕……啾咕……呼啊……好……吃」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_ce070bab:


    "文一脸兴奋地注视着以沉醉的表情伸出了舌头的伦。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_c91bdc1a:



    voice "d/2FU_0347"
    fumi "「我要不要也尝一下伦是什么味道的呢」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_067c55a5:



    voice "d/2RI_0399"
    rin "「啾啵……？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_818c2729:


    "文将塞在伦上面的嘴巴的手指拔了出来并贴近了脸吻向伦的脸颊。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_45da0e0a:



    voice "d/2FU_0348"
    fumi "「嗯……脸蛋也是。伦全身上下都热乎乎的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_e955173e:



    voice "d/2RI_0400"
    rin "「文的嘴唇……也一样……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_a6656733:



    voice "d/2FU_0349"
    fumi "「嗯嗯……啾……舔舔……嗯嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_0d34c318:


    "文的舌头在伦的脸颊上滑动着。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_b5c9b549:



    voice "d/2FU_0350"
    fumi "「……是伦的味道呢，真想让人吃掉啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_3686ac80:



    voice "d/2RI_0401"
    rin "「我应该没什么好吃的哦……？毕竟和文不一样，我身上没什么肉可以吃的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_a0cf66eb:


    "哦豁，完蛋。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_392a18fd:



    voice "d/2FU_0351"
    fumi "「呵、呵呵。放心吧我会把你做成好吃的料理喔～」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_a31cc3df:



    voice "d/2RI_0402"
    rin "「唏……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_a2a97880:


    "这话由料理水平高超的文嘴里说出来时真实感剧增，只不过眼神并没在笑就是了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_a222841a:



    voice "d/2FU_0352"
    fumi "「骗你的，我怎么可能会对我最重要的伦做那种事呢」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_de0a80bd:



    voice "d/2RI_0403"
    rin "「呃、嗯……啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene05_5a45f19a:


